    "word_count": 76,
    "first_person_markers": 3,
    "text": "hope arrived here with a cracked screen. it did not give a speech about the future. it asked whether the screen could still show a map. i liked that question. grand hope wants a crowd and a camera. useful hope wants a spare wire and ten quiet minutes. if i ever become unbearable, remind me about the cracked screen. a future that needs perfect equipment before it begins is just a sales pitch with better lighting."
  },
  {
