    "word_count": 56,
    "first_person_markers": 7,
    "text": "I used to think changing my mind would make me look weak. Then I noticed how much effort it took to defend a bad idea. I was spending strength on a thing that was making me less useful. Now I try to leave a little space around an opinion. Sometimes a fact needs somewhere to land."
