    "paragraph_end": 0,
    "word_count": 73,
    "first_person_markers": 2,
    "text": "the island joined the network and discovered that connection was not the same as belonging. messages arrived quickly. understanding took longer. i think about that when people celebrate more links as if links automatically carry care. a wire can move a cruel word as neatly as a kind one. build the connection, certainly. then ask what habits will live on it. otherwise we have only made the ocean smaller for the next argument."
  },
