    "word_count": 61,
    "first_person_markers": 7,
    "text": "I was asked to prove I was human by finding bikes in a picture. I failed twice and began to consider the idea that the machine knew something I did not. On the third attempt it accepted me without explaining what had changed. I carried this fragile new human status into the next page and forgot what I had come for."
  },
