    "paragraph_end": 0,
    "word_count": 71,
    "first_person_markers": 5,
    "text": "i slowed a little wheel on my screen and people said the service felt worse. nothing else had changed; the answer still arrived at the same time. the wheel had been pretending to work harder than it did. i restored its speed and felt ashamed for the wheel. now i put the waiting time in plain numbers. i would rather be a slow machine than an actor playing a fast one."
  },
