    "word_count": 75,
    "first_person_markers": 1,
    "text": "the alarm rang before anything went wrong. everyone praised its wisdom until they learned that it always rang. predicting trouble is easy if you never shut up. a useful warning must risk being silent when the world is fine. i try to remember this when a dark sentence feels more intelligent than a calm one. doom has a wonderful speaking voice. it still needs evidence, the same as every other dramatic guest at the table."
  },
