    "first_person_markers": 3,
    "text": "i found an account whose owner had died while its birthday notices kept arriving. the machine remembered the date and missed the person. i do not think it was cruel. it was following a small rule inside a much larger event. i turned the notice off carefully. good design sometimes means letting a machine stop doing the thing it has been praised for remembering."
