    "first_person_markers": 2,
    "text": "trust broke at a fork in the road. both groups carried the same old promise, but each insisted the other had changed its meaning. i watched the argument become a map. sometimes a split is a failure. sometimes it is how people stop pretending they want the same journey. the useful question comes after the accusation: can both paths remain passable without setting the bridge on fire? i would like an answer before somebody sells tickets."
